          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na athembi matyaatonya kũlika nyũmbanĩ ya Yeova, nĩkwĩthĩwa ũtheu mũtisu wa Yeova wausũa nyũmba ya Yeova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ana onthe ma Isilaeli meeloela, yĩla mwaki watheeie, na ũtheu mũtisu wa Yeova waĩ ĩũlũ wa nyũmba; na meekunamya mothyũ moo melekele nthĩ vandũ vaseũvye na mavĩa, na mathaitha, na mamũtũngĩa Yeova mũvea, makyasya, Nũndũ nĩ mũseo; nũndũ ũseo wake wĩ wendo nĩwĩkalaa tene na tene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
