        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ Solomoni avoka mboka ĩvinda yĩu mĩthenya mũonza, na Isilaeli onthe vamwe nake, ũmbano mũnene mũno kuma ũlikĩlonĩ wa Amathi kũvika ũsĩ wa Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũthenya wa nyanya maĩ na ũmbano ũkilĩtye: nũndũ nĩmalilikanile kũvathw’a kwa kĩthembeo kĩthĩwe kĩtheu mĩthenya mũonza, na mboka mĩthenya mũonza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ali 23.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũthenya wa mĩongo ĩlĩ na ĩtatũ wa mwei wa mũonza oombũũkya andũ maende maeemanĩ moo, me na mũyo na me atanu ngoonĩ nũndũ wa ũseo ũla Yeova wamwonetye Ndaviti, na Solomoni, na Isilaeli andũ make.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
